[{"id":185481805,"discussion_id":"b3d82bf3850fe79fba94dd669c191758733795bb","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本 PR 修复 `ImageProjectiveTransform` 算子在 `InferShape` 阶段对 unknown rank / 未知维度输入处理不当的问题。原实现在输入为 unknown rank 时会把 `{-2}` 当作普通 rank 校验而返回失败，在 `transforms` 末维为未知维度时也会因 `-1 != 8` 被错误拒绝。改动后，当 `images`、`transforms`、`output_shape` 任一输入为 unknown rank 时直接推导成功并将输出设为 unknown rank；`transforms` 末维为 `UNKNOWN_DIM` 时跳过无法确定的校验（已知非法维度仍返回失败）；同时将空指针校验与输出 shape 获取提前，并新增覆盖静态 shape、动态 batch、unknown shape、三类输入 unknown rank 及非法 rank 场景的 infershape 单元测试。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **unknown rank 短路推导**：在 `InferShapeImageProjectiveTransform` 中通过 `Ops::Base::IsUnknownRank` 判断三个输入（`images`、`transforms`、`output_shape`）任一为 unknown rank 时，直接 `Ops::Base::SetUnknownRank(*outShape)` 并返回 `GRAPH_SUCCESS`，避免将 `{-2}` 当作普通 rank 校验而误报失败。\n- **跳过无法确定的末维校验**：`ValidateTransforms` 中末维校验条件改为 `GetDim(1) != ge::UNKNOWN_DIM && GetDim(1) != TRANSFORMS_LAST_DIM`，使 `transforms.shape[1]` 为未知维度时不再被错误拒绝，已知非法维度仍返回失败。\n- **校验顺序与空指针处理调整**：将 `transforms`、`output_shape` 的输入 shape 与输出 shape 的空指针校验提前到 unknown rank 判断之前统一处理，并引入 `op_common/op_host/util/shape_util.h` 依赖，保证 unknown rank 分支可安全执行。\n- **新增 infershape 单元测试**：新增 `test_image_projective_transform_infershape.cpp`，覆盖 `output_shape` 常量覆盖 H/W、非常量回退输入 H/W、非正常量回退、动态 batch、`images`/`transforms`/`output_shape` 分别 unknown rank、全 unknown shape 以及非法 3D rank 等 9 个用例。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-19T10:52:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-19T10:57:53+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185481809,"discussion_id":"011e291e39a63a24d2ac22ad29be0edc39c5a5da","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-19T10:52:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-19T11:05:00+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461a